@booking = http://localhost:7001
@gateway = http://localhost:7002

### Consistency report: errors break ok; warnings do not
GET {{booking}}/admin/consistency

### Lost webhook and no return: reconciliation asks the gateway after 3 s instead of 15 s
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reconcileAfterMs": 3000 }

###
PUT {{gateway}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dropWebhooks": true }

### Late payment: 8 s hold, payment session closes at 6 s, the bank answers after 10 s
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "holdTtlMs": 8000, "paymentMarginMs": 2000 }

###
PUT {{gateway}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slowPayMs": 10000 }

### Our webhook endpoint answers 503 (the gateway retries with backoff)
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "webhooksDown": true }

### Real crash when the next webhook arrives (restart with pnpm start:booking)
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "crashPoint": "beforeConfirm" }

### Real crash after the gateway created a session, before we store its id
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "crashPoint": "afterSession" }

### Find a session by our booking id (what reconciliation does when we lost the id)
GET {{gateway}}/admin/sessions?merchantRef=<booking-id>

### Back to defaults
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches/reset

###
PUT {{gateway}}/admin/switches/reset
